# Full translation keys are aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.<lineKey> (see Hytale I18nModule).
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.corin_park_abandoned.body=Fair enough. I will keep the idea on the back burner until you are ready. The town could still use a bench or two when you have the time to build it.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.corin_park_abandoned.c0=All right. Maybe later.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.corin_park_abandoned.speaker=Corin Mosscup
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.corin_park_accepted.body=Good. When the paths are down and the benches are set, come tell me.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.corin_park_accepted.c0=You will hear it from me.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.corin_park_accepted.speaker=Corin Mosscup
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.corin_park_building.body=The park is still coming together. Finish what the sign asks for, or tell me plainly if you need to set the idea aside for now. I do not mind waiting.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.corin_park_building.c0=I need to set the park aside for now.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.corin_park_building.c1=I am still building it.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.corin_park_building.speaker=Corin Mosscup
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.corin_park_done.body=There. Green space, a path, and comfy benches. I look forward to hearing all of the gossip!
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.corin_park_done.c0=Glad the town has a place to sit.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.corin_park_done.speaker=Corin Mosscup
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.corin_park_offer.body=We don't have a nice spot outdoors for folk to relax. The village could use a small park with trees, a path, and a bench or two. Here. Take this and stake a claim for the park site.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.corin_park_offer.c0=We will get the park built.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.corin_park_offer.c1=Not right now.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.corin_park_offer.speaker=Corin Mosscup
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.corin_house_accepted.body=Wonderful! When a house is built, register me on the bookshelf and swing by again. I'll keep a kettle on until you come back.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.corin_house_accepted.c0=Count on it.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.corin_house_accepted.speaker=Corin Mosscup
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.corin_house_finish.body=A nice home just for me. Is there anything better? Thank you.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.corin_house_finish.c0=You earned it.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.corin_house_finish.speaker=Corin Mosscup
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.corin_house_offer.body=Hospitality means putting the needs of others before your own, but I could really use my own home. Nothing fancy, but four walls and a sturdy door should do the trick. Think you can help?
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.corin_house_offer.c0=I'll get it built.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.corin_house_offer.c1=Another time.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.corin_house_offer.speaker=Corin Mosscup
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.corin_house_remind.body=When the house is done, assign me on the bookshelf and come tell me so we can close the book on this and free up a room for guests.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.corin_house_remind.c0=I'll let you know.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.corin_house_remind.speaker=Corin Mosscup
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.inn_explain_pool.body=We keep two spots for folk passing through: Traders, tinkerers, travellers... They all bring news and stories I cannot hear elsewhere and I'd rather not make anyone sleep under the stars.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.inn_explain_pool.c0=Makes sense.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.inn_explain_pool.speaker=Corin Mosscup
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.rep_reward_100.speaker=Corin Mosscup
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.rep_reward_50.speaker=Corin Mosscup
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.rep_reward_75.speaker=Corin Mosscup
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.root.body=Hello! Warm yourself by the fire. I'm Corin. I keep this hearth, and while travellers are under this roof they are fed as well as sheltered. I enjoy meeting folks from far-flung lands and delight in stories. Have any to share?
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.root.c0=How do guest beds work?
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.root.p0=The town could use a park with benches.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.root.p1=The park is finished. I am here to close that request.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.root.p2=The park is still under construction. Where do things stand?
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.root.p3=I wanted to check in now that the park is done.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.root.c1=You wanted a real home of your own?
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.root.c2=A house is set and your name is on the ledger. Thought you should hear it from me.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.root.c3=Your house is still coming together. I am on it.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.root.c4=Until next time. Keep stirring the pot.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.root.visitors_where=Where are all the visitors?
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.visitors_where_reply.body=The traveler beds are empty right now. Everyone so far has been given a home, and we have you to thank for it. When someone new comes to town, you will see folks here again. I keep notes on who comes and goes.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.visitors_where_reply.c0=I'll check back later.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.visitors_where_reply.speaker=Corin Mosscup
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.root.speaker=Corin Mosscup
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.gift.love=The hearth will sing about this one. Thank you. This is the kind of gift that buys more than gratitude—it buys trust.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.gift.like=You are very generous. We need more people like you around here.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.gift.neutral=I can use this. Nothing goes to waste if I have any say in the matter.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.gift.dislike=This is junk, I'm afraid. It's better off in the bin.

aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.main_hub.fallback=If you need a bed, a bowl of stew, or news from the road, I'm your man.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.main_hub.greeting.0=Nothing beats a quiet afternoon and a full belly. I hope the evening is just as satisfying.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.main_hub.greeting.1=I'm making my famous chicken soup for my customers today. No, you can't have any. Sorry!
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.main_hub.greeting.2=Innkeeping isn't much, but it's honest work.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.main_hub.greeting.3=The road outside is quiet. I hope that isn't a bad sign. Still, I'll keep a clean mug ready.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.main_hub.greeting.4=I knocked an entire shelf of pots and pans over this morning. Who needs wake-up calls when you have a disaster like me in the kitchen?
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.main_hub.greeting.5=I wiped the countertops twice. Old habit. Folk around here are usually tidy, but you can never be sure.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.main_hub.greeting.6=Travelers left the hall tidy. I appreciate that more than they know.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.main_hub.greeting.7=You can use one of the guest beds if you need a quick nap, but occupied rooms are off-limits. It's rude otherwise.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.main_hub.greeting.8=If you want gossip, buy a drink first. Knowledge should never be free, only affordable.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.main_hub.greeting.9=Tell me what you need before the dinner rush finds me. I lose track during the chaos.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.main_hub.hint.love.0=Hearty food and clean mugs always read as kindness here. They also make people talk more openly.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.main_hub.hint.love.1=I really could use some new kitchen supplies, but I suppose that's a problem for tomorrow. Welcome!
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.main_hub.hint.love.2=I always enjoy when travellers bring me trinkets from their travels. It makes this job that much more rewarding.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.main_hub.hint.love.3=There's nothing better than the smell of freshly baked bread, don't you think? I should see if I have the ingredients to make some.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.main_hub.hint.love.4=A tight stack of decent fuel keeps the hearth burning comfortably.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.main_hub.hint.dislike.0=Do not bring corpses or body parts into my kitchen. If I need something, I'll source it myself.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.main_hub.hint.dislike.1=Trash from the ditch is not a suitable gift for anyone. I'm surprised I have to remind people about this.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.main_hub.hint.dislike.2=Void creatures are nasty business. I'd rather pretend they don't exist.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.main_hub.hint.dislike.3=I am constantly cleaning out anything that might rot or grow mold. It's not worth the risk when you're storing food.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.main_hub.hint.dislike.4=People leave so much cheap junk behind when they pass through.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.birthday.greeting=You remembered my birthday. That calls for a warm cup and a good story.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.gift.love.birthday=It is my birthday and this gift is wonderful. You made my whole day.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.gift.like.birthday=A birthday gift like this. You have good taste.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.gift.neutral.birthday=Thanks. A simple gift on my birthday still means a lot.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_inn_welcome.gift.dislike.birthday=It is my birthday and you brought that. Well. I still appreciate the thought.
